
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ATELIER — Digital Art Museum</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <header class="header">
    <a href="#" class="logo">ATELIER<span>.</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">HOME</a>
      <a href="#exhibition">EXHIBITION</a>
      <a href="#collection">COLLECTION</a>
      <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <p class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO THE DIGITAL ART MUSEUM</p>
      <h1>ART IS A<br><span>UNIVERSE.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-text">
        다양한 작품과 이야기가 모이는<br>
        나만의 디지털 미술관에 오신 것을 환영합니다.
      </p>
      <a href="#exhibition" class="main-button">전시관 둘러보기 ↗</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="exhibition">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 — EXHIBITION</p>
      <h2>전시관</h2>
      <p class="section-description">원하는 전시관을 선택해 작품을 감상해 보세요.</p>

      <div class="exhibition-grid">
        <a href="#collection" class="exhibition-card">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>ILLUSTRATION</h3>
          <p>일러스트 전시관</p>
        </a>

        <a href="#collection" class="exhibition-card">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>CHARACTER</h3>
          <p>캐릭터 전시관</p>
        </a>

        <a href="#collection" class="exhibition-card">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>PORTRAIT</h3>
          <p>인물화 전시관</p>
        </a>

        <a href="#collection" class="exhibition-card">
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>DRAWING</h3>
          <p>드로잉 전시관</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="collection">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 — COLLECTION</p>
      <h2>작품 아카이브</h2>
      <p class="section-description">마음에 드는 작품을 찾아보세요.</p>

      <div class="tools">
        <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="작품 제목 검색...">
        <select id="category">
          <option value="all">전체 작품</option>
          <option value="일러스트">일러스트</option>
          <option value="캐릭터">캐릭터</option>
          <option value="인물화">인물화</option>
          <option value="드로잉">드로잉</option>
        </select>
        <button id="randomButton">랜덤 추천</button>
        <button id="favoritesButton">즐겨찾기 보기</button>
      </div>

      <div class="art-grid" id="artGrid">
        <article class="art-card" data-title="붉은 밤" data-category="일러스트" data-year="2026" data-description="붉은 빛이 가득한 밤의 분위기를 표현한 일러스트입니다.">
          <div class="art-image image-one"></div>
          <div class="art-info">
            <div>
              <p>ILLUSTRATION</p>
              <h3>붉은 밤</h3>
              <span>2026</span>
            </div>
            <button class="favorite" aria-label="즐겨찾기">☆</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="art-card" data-title="이방인" data-category="캐릭터" data-year="2026" data-description="독특한 분위기와 개성을 가진 가상의 캐릭터 작품입니다.">
          <div class="art-image image-two"></div>
          <div class="art-info">
            <div>
              <p>CHARACTER</p>
              <h3>이방인</h3>
              <span>2026</span>
            </div>
            <button class="favorite" aria-label="즐겨찾기">☆</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="art-card" data-title="시선" data-category="인물화" data-year="2026" data-description="인물의 표정과 시선을 중심으로 표현한 작품입니다.">
          <div class="art-image image-three"></div>
          <div class="art-info">
            <div>
              <p>PORTRAIT</p>
              <h3>시선</h3>
              <span>2026</span>
            </div>
            <button class="favorite" aria-label="즐겨찾기">☆</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="art-card" data-title="흔적" data-category="드로잉" data-year="2026" data-description="선과 형태를 활용해 감정을 표현한 드로잉 작품입니다.">
          <div class="art-image image-four"></div>
          <div class="art-info">
            <div>
              <p>DRAWING</p>
              <h3>흔적</h3>
              <span>2026</span>
            </div>
            <button class="favorite" aria-label="즐겨찾기">☆</button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p id="emptyMessage" hidden>검색 결과가 없습니다.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 — ABOUT</p>
      <h2>ART HAS NO LIMITS.</h2>
      <p>작품에는 저마다의 이야기와 의미가 담겨 있습니다.<br>
      이곳에서 다양한 예술의 세계를 만나보세요.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="modal" id="artModal">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <button id="closeModal" class="close-button">✕</button>
      <p id="modalCategory"></p>
      <h2 id="modalTitle"></h2>
      <p id="modalYear"></p>
      <p id="modalDescription"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <a href="#home" class="logo">ATELIER<span>.</span></a>
    <p>© 2026 ATELIER DIGITAL ART MUSEUM</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
